Note on data: this project analyses the M5 Forecasting competition dataset,
which is distributed by Kaggle under the competition's own rules and is NOT
included in this repository. No M5 data, derived warehouse, or model artifact
is committed here — only the code that produces them. Obtain the data from
https://www.kaggle.com/competitions/m5-forecasting-accuracy/data under its own
terms.
